[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18606.19, "timestamp": "05:10:06", "text": "好吧，他好像在說，他們為什麼要這麼做，因為這不酷，他們明明可以做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18614.23, "timestamp": "05:10:14", "text": "很多很酷的事情，我就想，可能是作者不想讓小說的每個部分都那麼酷吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18626.55, "timestamp": "05:10:26", "text": "。誰知道呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18634.628, "timestamp": "05:10:34", "text": "？也許他不想讓整部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18637.59, "timestamp": "05:10:37", "text": "動畫變成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18639.35, "timestamp": "05:10:39", "text": "打鬥場面。是啊。就像我跟我朋友說的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18645.83, "timestamp": "05:10:45", "text": "我有個很火紅的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18658.31, "timestamp": "05:10:58", "text": "看看"}]